{%- comment -%}
  Local override of al_folio_core's _includes/footer.liquid.

  Renders nothing: this site shows no footer at all. The gem's version hardcodes
  a "© Copyright <year> <name>. <site.footer_text>" line, so blanking
  `footer_text` in _config.yml alone would still leave the copyright behind.

  To bring a footer back, delete this file (the gem's version takes over again)
  and set `footer_text` in _config.yml.
{%- endcomment -%}
